    "finalReminder": "A small beginning is not a small ambition; it is a practical way to give an ambition somewhere to stand. Make the useful action easier to start, keep the promise realistic, learn from feedback, and return after interruptions without turning one missed day into a permanent verdict. Consistency is not flawless performance. It is the repeated decision to begin again with better information."
