    "kind": "free",
    "finalReminder": "Patience is not passive waiting and it is not endless endurance. It is steady effort paired with attention to evidence. Prepare carefully, keep your effort sustainable, allow a process the time it reasonably needs, and change direction when facts show that the plan is not working. Some growth is invisible before it becomes clear. Take the next appropriate step, review what happens, and do not confuse a slower pace with a lack of progress."
