    "kind": "free",
    "finalReminder": "Time is limited, so spend it with intention rather than guilt. Notice what your calendar reveals, distinguish urgency from importance, leave room for the unexpected, and say no when a commitment would make another promise impossible to honour. Give people genuine attention and review routines that no longer serve their purpose. The goal is not to fill every hour; it is to give enough of your hours to what matters."
